  "gaps": [
    "Azure deployment, cleanup, package publication, key access and resource-provider actions are not exhaustively inventoried. Graph mode uses shared keys for Function host/deployment storage; its Blob RBAC row does not cover this authority.",
    "adminConfigured is an optional route in both graph and logAnalytics modes. Teams managed connector consent, connected-user channel privileges and runtime delegated authority require live tenant-specific qualification; no exact connector permission is inferred.",
    "Baseline Entra roles are alternatives: Security Administrator or Conditional Access Administrator with Reports Reader and Security Reader. Graph consent additionally supports Global Administrator or Privileged Role Administrator. Recorded representative alternatives are not instructions to assign roles cumulatively.",
    "Graph and log-analytics are mutually exclusive notification modes. The optional union is comparison metadata, not a recommended grant bundle; the external workflowWebhook route has unknown receiver-side authorization.",
    "Existing-workspace query access, diagnostic ingestion/licensing prerequisites and Azure Monitor execution authority need independent qualification; no Sentinel permissions or workspace creation are inferred."
  ]
